* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制文件不做换行转换，也不参与文本 diff
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.zip binary
*.wav binary
*.mp3 binary
*.ogg binary

